    "y": 212,
    "w": 769,
    "h": 50
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "This is a point of access to the Gas Release System (GRS) where the separation of free gas and liquid occurs. The gas will be directed upwards finding an exit port to the casing, releasing the gas (green flow path).",
