    "x": 441,
    "y": 288,
    "w": 769,
    "h": 76
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "On the other hand, the gas-free liquid descends to the bottom of the GRS entering the dip tube with a 45-degree cut allowing the flow towards the pump (yellow flow path).",
